# Inquisition of Kozilek and a split card (CR 708.4): outside the stack a split card's mana value is the total of both halves,
# so Life // Death in Bot2's hand is Life {G} + Death {1}{B} = 3 and eligible, where the Sunfall (5) is not. Bot1 takes
# Life // Death; the Sunfall stays in Bot2's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Inquisition of Kozilek
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Sunfall
Life // Death
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Inquisition of Kozilek.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Life // Death)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Life // Death
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
